    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Foris is a social media influencer that finds herself in a somewhat unique situation: She's stuck in a <span class=\"bb_strike\">death game</span> rehabilitation program with 13 <span class=\"bb_strike\">criminals</span> other young people! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924880/extras/136d1e517123119fb816bdd5047c3173.avif?t=1746169566\" data-has-big width=800 height=497 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a whim, she was given a rare opportunity, though: She can redeem herself by completing her captor's fashion challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Foris sweet-talk the other participants into giving her more clothes, put together fashionable outfits, and impress her hosts \u2014 for a chance to regain access to the outside world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924880/extras/326d2cef219bbf7a0349ea37cf6bba10.poster.avif?t=1746169566\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924880/extras/326d2cef219bbf7a0349ea37cf6bba10.webm?t=1746169566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 stylish outfits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >139 unique pieces of clothing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-2 hours of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >endless mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924880/extras/efe403e0424c88efeb1d55b9086aea4f.avif?t=1746169566\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Artificial Fashionista</i> is a spin-off of my current main project, <i>Artificial Selection</i>, but it is meant to be fully enjoyable on its own!</p>",
