ttps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924880/extras/efe403e0424c88efeb1d55b9086aea4f.avif?t=1746169566\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Artificial Fashionista</i> is a spin-off of my current main project, <i>Artificial Selection</i>, but it is meant to be fully enjoyable on its own!</p>",
